WEBVTT

00:04.879 --> 00:10.051
Over a century ago, beings that prey
on humans suddenly appeared.

00:15.598 --> 00:20.311
Their overwhelming strength

00:20.895 --> 00:24.149
quickly pushed humanity
to the brink of extinction.

00:29.571 --> 00:35.744
The surviving humans constructed
three walls, Maria, Rose, and Sina,

00:36.077 --> 00:38.913
which brought them a century of peace.

00:39.664 --> 00:40.665
However...

02:33.153 --> 02:36.489
"Until that time,
I had been a wretched soul

02:36.573 --> 02:39.951
and wholly given to greed!

02:41.035 --> 02:46.583
Now, as thou see'st,
I'm punished for it here!

02:48.293 --> 02:50.712
What avarice doth is here,

02:51.421 --> 02:56.301
made manifest
in this purgation of converted souls!

02:58.344 --> 03:04.309
Nor hath this Mount
a penalty more bitter!"

03:18.781 --> 03:19.866
Stop!

03:19.949 --> 03:21.326
Let me go!

03:21.409 --> 03:23.703
"O Avarice!

03:24.120 --> 03:27.332
Thou hast to thyself so drawn my race,

03:27.624 --> 03:32.420
that even for its own flesh it careth not!

03:32.795 --> 03:36.174
What more canst thou do with us?"

03:40.803 --> 03:44.182
"O Avarice! Thou hast to thyself--"

03:57.820 --> 03:59.364
Eren! What are you doing?

03:59.656 --> 04:02.200
We were so close to saving Mom!

04:02.575 --> 04:04.494
Why couldn't you mind your own business?

04:04.869 --> 04:08.039
- We were so close to saving her!
- Knock it off, damn it!

04:09.624 --> 04:10.458
Eren!

04:16.047 --> 04:16.923
Eren.

04:20.051 --> 04:22.595
You couldn't save your mother

04:23.680 --> 04:25.431
because you don't have enough strength.

04:28.685 --> 04:29.602
And I...

04:31.354 --> 04:34.190
I couldn't stand up to the Titan

04:35.733 --> 04:38.027
because I don't have enough courage!

04:49.247 --> 04:50.456
I'm sorry.

05:02.010 --> 05:04.178
It happened again...

05:18.860 --> 05:21.362
Hurry! To the inner gate!

05:21.988 --> 05:25.575
Escape aboard the boat there!

05:26.576 --> 05:29.579
Hurry! Before you get eaten!

05:42.884 --> 05:44.844
City districts like Shiganshina,

05:44.927 --> 05:47.346
which stick out
like vital spots along the wall,

05:47.680 --> 05:54.020
serve to attract the Titans and streamline
security costs and troop numbers.

05:54.937 --> 05:58.274
Performing true to its role
as a Titan target,

05:58.357 --> 06:04.322
Shiganshina had one inner gate
through which its citizens could flee.

06:07.992 --> 06:09.744
Leave your belongings!

06:09.827 --> 06:11.913
Let on as many people as possible!

06:17.043 --> 06:18.920
Sit, Armin.

06:19.128 --> 06:21.881
But Eren and Mikasa still aren't here...

06:23.508 --> 06:24.509
There they are!

06:27.011 --> 06:27.929
Eren?

06:30.431 --> 06:32.475
Just let him be for now.

06:33.226 --> 06:36.646
That poor thing.
He must be very traumatized...

06:36.979 --> 06:37.897
What?

06:40.191 --> 06:42.985
Why are you dawdling? Hurry the hell up!

06:43.069 --> 06:44.654
Get those cannons loaded!

06:52.537 --> 06:53.913
Hurry!

06:53.996 --> 06:55.748
They're closing in!

07:10.012 --> 07:12.974
This can't be for real...

07:13.057 --> 07:16.769
Please, God...

07:16.978 --> 07:18.146
Hey!

07:19.814 --> 07:20.857
Hey! What are you doing?

07:20.940 --> 07:23.443
It's at full capacity! It has to leave!

07:23.526 --> 07:26.863
No, please! At least let our children on!

07:26.946 --> 07:28.698
I'm sorry, but we can't!

07:28.948 --> 07:30.199
Get going!

07:33.786 --> 07:36.330
- Let us on!
- Let us on!

07:52.430 --> 07:54.515
You idiot! What are you aiming for?

07:54.599 --> 07:58.978
But, sir, these aren't
accurate enough to aim with!

07:59.061 --> 08:03.441
I don't give a crap! Reload them at once!

08:03.524 --> 08:04.775
It's no use!

08:10.198 --> 08:12.241
The gate is closing...

08:12.742 --> 08:14.994
Retreat! We're going to get left behind!

08:15.077 --> 08:16.037
Hey!

08:17.622 --> 08:20.041
Don't shut it! Hold on a little longer!

08:20.458 --> 08:22.877
There are still lots of people there!

08:23.127 --> 08:24.879
If the Titans get through,

08:25.296 --> 08:28.674
the town being overrun
will be the least of our worries!

08:28.883 --> 08:32.512
All of mankind will be forced
to withdraw behind the next wall!

08:32.595 --> 08:36.724
But that's not a reason to leave
these people to die!

08:37.475 --> 08:38.476
Shut it! Hurry!

08:38.559 --> 08:39.977
The Titans are coming!

08:41.229 --> 08:42.730
Close the gate at once!

08:44.690 --> 08:45.900
Stop!

08:47.527 --> 08:48.819
Hey!

09:27.108 --> 09:28.359
What the...

09:30.236 --> 09:31.529
It's...

09:32.321 --> 09:33.489
Fire!

09:40.955 --> 09:43.207
- What?
- It has no effect?

09:46.002 --> 09:47.253
It's...

09:49.046 --> 09:52.174
It's coming! Retreat!

09:52.550 --> 09:55.595
A Titan is coming! It's charging this way!

09:55.678 --> 09:58.347
Hurry! Shut the gate!

10:33.549 --> 10:34.592
The gate...

10:53.194 --> 10:57.531
Within hours of the fall of Shiganshina
on the south side of Wall Maria,

10:58.491 --> 11:03.746
news of the incident had reached
every city inside the human territory.

11:05.039 --> 11:08.959
Is it true that the Titans have
overrun Shiganshina?

11:09.043 --> 11:09.919
TROST DISTRICT, WALL ROSE

11:10.002 --> 11:11.295
I can't believe this!

11:11.587 --> 11:14.465
The walls have held strong
for a century! Why now?

11:14.673 --> 11:16.425
Whether we believe it or not,

11:16.717 --> 11:19.428
the fact is that refugees
have fled here by boat!

11:19.887 --> 11:22.640
Reports say there are 500 on board.

11:22.973 --> 11:26.268
The question is, if Shiganshina was
the only one affected...

11:26.977 --> 11:32.024
Surely, they couldn't have
gotten through Wall Maria as well, right?

11:35.027 --> 11:36.070
In any case,

11:36.404 --> 11:38.572
we must contact the Royal Government
for instructions.

11:38.948 --> 11:43.244
This crisis is too much
for us to handle on our own.

11:44.120 --> 11:45.454
I'm sorry to interrupt!

11:45.788 --> 11:47.081
A courier horse has just arrived!

11:47.832 --> 11:52.211
Titans have breached Wall Maria
and entered its interior!

11:59.885 --> 12:01.095
It's over...

12:02.972 --> 12:03.931
It's all over...

12:05.099 --> 12:08.436
The Titans are going
to devour humanity again...

12:09.562 --> 12:10.604
This is the end...

12:12.898 --> 12:13.732
I'll...

12:14.024 --> 12:15.234
never see that house...

12:16.068 --> 12:17.486
ever again...

12:21.365 --> 12:22.575
Why...

12:23.701 --> 12:27.121
Why did I argue for no reason?
Why was that all I could do?

12:28.205 --> 12:29.748
Now, Mom's gone!

12:31.417 --> 12:32.793
She's never coming back!

12:35.796 --> 12:37.006
Why?

12:38.132 --> 12:41.510
Because you don't have enough strength.

12:43.554 --> 12:46.557
It's because I'm weak...
Because humans are weak...

12:47.308 --> 12:49.852
Is crying the only thing the weak can do?

13:05.284 --> 13:06.327
I'm...

13:06.660 --> 13:07.745
going to...

13:08.329 --> 13:09.205
Eren.

13:09.455 --> 13:10.998
What has gotten into you, Eren?

13:12.374 --> 13:13.250
Eren...

13:14.835 --> 13:16.587
...drive them out!

13:18.047 --> 13:19.340
I'm going to drive out

13:20.341 --> 13:22.134
every last one of them from this world!

13:23.928 --> 13:24.845
Eren...

13:31.352 --> 13:35.564
That same year, the Royal Government
made the decision

13:35.773 --> 13:39.026
to withdraw all of humanity's
domain behind Wall Rose.

13:39.944 --> 13:44.615
Around 10,000 people were eaten
by the Titans during that time.

13:46.784 --> 13:47.785
Eren...

13:48.035 --> 13:48.953
Carla...

13:49.328 --> 13:50.329
Mikasa...

13:50.955 --> 13:52.414
Please be all right!

13:55.960 --> 13:56.961
Eren!

13:57.753 --> 13:58.754
Eren!

13:59.255 --> 14:00.256
Eren!

14:00.881 --> 14:01.799
Eren!

14:02.299 --> 14:03.342
Dad!

14:03.425 --> 14:04.927
Stop, Dad!

14:05.928 --> 14:07.972
What are you trying to do?

14:08.305 --> 14:09.974
Just give me your arm!

14:10.057 --> 14:10.975
No!

14:11.141 --> 14:14.186
Mom's death has made you go crazy!

14:14.270 --> 14:15.271
Eren!

14:15.354 --> 14:17.481
Let go, Dad!

14:17.690 --> 14:18.816
It's for...

14:18.899 --> 14:19.984
your own sake!

14:20.067 --> 14:21.777
What are you talking about?

14:21.861 --> 14:24.321
Listen! Don't forget the key!

14:24.572 --> 14:26.949
You must reach it!

14:27.157 --> 14:30.995
Until you learn the truth someday...

14:39.545 --> 14:41.797
Eren. Are you okay?

14:41.964 --> 14:43.090
You were having a nightmare.

14:44.800 --> 14:47.720
I feel like I just saw Dad...

14:47.928 --> 14:49.972
No. You were dreaming.

14:51.557 --> 14:53.183
I see...

14:57.021 --> 14:57.855
Let's go.

14:58.898 --> 15:00.983
They said they're going to hand out food.

15:06.196 --> 15:09.116
Apparently, this was
their food storehouse.

15:09.783 --> 15:12.578
They've gathered
all the boat refugees here.

15:24.048 --> 15:26.550
- Hey! Get in line, will you?
- Shut up!

15:26.634 --> 15:29.762
I haven't eaten anything since last night!

15:29.845 --> 15:32.431
We can't say we've survived just yet.

15:33.891 --> 15:34.767
Eren!

15:34.850 --> 15:35.851
Mikasa!

15:36.393 --> 15:37.478
Armin...

15:39.021 --> 15:41.065
Here! Just in time!

15:41.398 --> 15:45.027
My grandpa got us some
by saying it was for children!

15:45.319 --> 15:46.236
Thank you.

15:53.285 --> 15:54.536
What's his problem?

15:54.745 --> 15:55.871
You can't blame him.

15:56.330 --> 15:59.124
There probably isn't
enough food to go around.

15:59.875 --> 16:01.585
And that's an entire day's worth.

16:02.211 --> 16:04.171
There are just too many refugees.

16:04.296 --> 16:06.298
There was already
a food shortage going on.

16:06.507 --> 16:09.969
Plus, the people aren't treated
as well as the citizens on the outer wall.

16:10.052 --> 16:11.345
- This is mine!
- Shut up!

16:11.428 --> 16:14.348
Why should we give our food
to some lousy outsiders?

16:15.891 --> 16:18.060
If you ask me,
if the Titans got through the wall,

16:18.310 --> 16:21.146
they could've at least eaten
some more people!

16:25.067 --> 16:26.026
Eren!

16:26.360 --> 16:29.947
This is just going to make
the food shortage even worse.

16:30.364 --> 16:31.240
Hey!

16:32.700 --> 16:34.660
What the hell, you damn kid?

16:37.496 --> 16:39.331
You don't know what it's like!

16:39.748 --> 16:42.042
You've never even seen it!

16:43.210 --> 16:46.213
You've never seen
what the Titans do to people!

16:48.048 --> 16:49.091
Shut up!

16:49.174 --> 16:50.300
I apologize!

16:50.551 --> 16:52.928
He's just hungry and irritable!

16:53.012 --> 16:56.098
That's why he rudely
lashed out at an adult...

16:57.224 --> 16:59.518
I'm very sorry!

17:02.896 --> 17:03.897
Man...

17:04.231 --> 17:08.444
It's because of us that you guys
aren't starving to death, you know!

17:09.361 --> 17:12.740
Even you kids should be thankful to us!

17:12.948 --> 17:13.824
Of course!

17:14.575 --> 17:15.576
Damn...

17:16.160 --> 17:18.454
I refuse to let them take care of me.

17:20.789 --> 17:23.333
I'm going back to Wall Maria!

17:24.126 --> 17:26.462
I'm going to destroy every last Titan!

17:26.920 --> 17:27.838
Eren...

17:28.213 --> 17:29.965
You're not being serious, are you?

17:30.049 --> 17:31.258
I'm serious!

17:32.092 --> 17:35.387
I'm not like those guys who do nothing
but act tough inside the walls!

17:36.805 --> 17:38.640
I don't need this crap!

17:40.309 --> 17:42.686
Eren, you'll starve to death!

17:42.770 --> 17:44.605
Doesn't it bother you at all?

17:45.064 --> 17:48.067
We can't beat the Titans
because we accept everyone's charity!

17:48.150 --> 17:50.277
It's impossible!
There is no way to beat them!

17:50.486 --> 17:52.905
All we can do is live inside the walls!

17:53.280 --> 17:56.366
If we try anything, we'll die!
Just like my mom and dad!

17:56.450 --> 18:00.120
So you're going to grovel?
Don't you have any shame?

18:00.204 --> 18:02.539
There's nothing we can do for now!

18:02.623 --> 18:04.374
That's just an excuse!

18:04.458 --> 18:07.711
If you want to live
like livestock forever, go ahead!

18:07.795 --> 18:09.004
You wimp!

18:13.258 --> 18:14.259
Mikasa...

18:23.393 --> 18:27.064
If Armin's a wimp, then so are we.

18:27.397 --> 18:31.068
Whether it was running
from the Titans or fleeing the town,

18:31.276 --> 18:33.487
we couldn't manage anything on our own.

18:35.072 --> 18:37.491
We even had help finding food today.

18:38.242 --> 18:39.952
There's no way powerless people

18:40.619 --> 18:43.205
could defeat even a single one
of those Titans.

18:45.249 --> 18:47.543
Staying alive is what matters most.

18:48.252 --> 18:49.878
Just like what your mother said.

18:56.218 --> 18:57.219
Mikasa...

18:57.803 --> 19:00.347
You have to eat and stay alive.

19:00.764 --> 19:02.766
I won't let you starve to death.

19:14.486 --> 19:17.823
Several days later,
the throngs of refugees

19:17.948 --> 19:21.743
were tasked with cultivating
the wastelands to secure food.

19:24.454 --> 19:26.874
However,
the food shortage was unavoidable.

19:27.457 --> 19:29.751
So, in the following year of 846,

19:29.918 --> 19:33.005
the Royal Government sent
a multitude of refugees on a mission

19:33.130 --> 19:36.049
in the name of retaking Wall Maria.

19:44.433 --> 19:46.727
Of the 250,000 people that were sent,

19:48.270 --> 19:50.564
which was nearly 20 percent
of the population,

19:50.898 --> 19:53.609
not even 200 survived.

19:55.402 --> 19:59.448
Although it wasn't much,
their sacrifices did improve

19:59.656 --> 20:01.992
the food shortage situation
for the rest of the population.

20:15.756 --> 20:17.382
It's all the Titans' fault.

20:18.550 --> 20:20.344
If we could just subdue them,

20:21.803 --> 20:24.181
we could have a place in the world again.

20:26.850 --> 20:27.684
Armin.

20:28.810 --> 20:30.812
I'm going to apply
for the Cadets next year.

20:34.608 --> 20:36.860
I'm going to gain the strength
to fight the Titans!

20:41.240 --> 20:42.115
Me too...

20:42.199 --> 20:43.200
Armin?

20:43.450 --> 20:44.493
Me too!

20:45.953 --> 20:47.079
I will, too.

20:47.621 --> 20:48.580
Mikasa...

20:48.789 --> 20:52.834
You don't need to! You said so yourself.
Staying alive is what's important!

20:53.418 --> 20:57.089
Yes, that's why I'm doing it.
So you won't die.

21:02.094 --> 21:04.304
All right. The three of us, then.

21:12.229 --> 21:17.192
The 104th Cadet Corps Class
entrance ceremony will now begin!

21:17.526 --> 21:22.364
You have the misfortune of having me,
Keith Sadies, as your commandant!

21:22.823 --> 21:25.284
I do not welcome you warmly!

21:25.367 --> 21:28.620
In your current state, you'd be
nothing but food for the Titans!

21:28.704 --> 21:31.790
You're mere livestock!
You're less than livestock!

21:32.249 --> 21:37.587
Over the next three years,
we're going to train you worthless pukes

21:37.879 --> 21:40.507
and teach you how to fight the Titans!

21:40.882 --> 21:44.303
Three years from now, when you come
face-to-face with the Titans,

21:44.469 --> 21:46.430
will you still be fodder for them?

21:46.513 --> 21:50.225
Will you serve as an honorable
barrier that protects the king?

21:50.309 --> 21:54.521
Or will you be a glorious soldier
for humanity that drives the Titans out?

21:54.688 --> 21:56.231
It's up to you to decide!

21:57.649 --> 22:00.027
Yes, I'll be one.

22:01.903 --> 22:04.781
I'll drive out every last Titan!

23:45.674 --> 23:47.300
He fails as a soldier.

23:48.051 --> 23:52.097
Eren joins the Cadets,
vowing revenge against the Titans,

23:52.514 --> 23:57.686
but his failure at basic training
comes as a harsh reality.
